SUSPECTED BUG: guard at the call site. respond(out, srv.Serve(ctx, req)) returns only errors that are NOT *api.Error,
wrapped "server: unhandled: %w". Correct set: 1 entry, Recover's opaque "middleware: panic serving %s: %v" behind
"server: unhandled: %w". Actual: 208 entries: respond's errors.As guard works (the *api.Error values are gone), but
Serve's set is the over-approximated, fixpoint-limited one of api_serve_decl, so untranslated domain, parse, audit and
filerepo errors are reported as unhandled server errors.
-- args --
-fanout=2 cmd/server/main.go:@respond_call
